# BMW 5 Series F10 four-door saloon, 2010-2017.
#
# The F10 5-series: 4,899 mm long, 1,860 mm wide, 1,464 mm high, 2,968 mm
# wheelbase; 2.0-4.4 petrol and 2.0/3.0 diesel, the 520d the volume fleet model.
# Facelift (LCI) in 2013. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_5_Series_(F10)
#
# Colours: Black Sapphire, Glacier Silver, Imperial Blue and Alpine White are
# documented BMW finishes of the period.
#
# Weight: 150 in total (black 55, silver 40, blue 30, white 25).
#
# Speed 250 km/h; comfort 135/385 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 2010-2017 with a road tail to about 2028.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-f10.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bmw-f10/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

